	<section_number>10.1-1607</section_number>
	<catch_line>Interim receipts or temporary bonds</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Authority is authorized to issue interim receipts or temporary bonds as provided in § 15.2-2616 and to execute and deliver new bonds in place of bonds mutilated, lost or destroyed, as provided in § 15.2-2621.
	</text>
	<history>1986, c. 360, § 10-158.6; 1988, c. 891.</history>
</law>
